Pipeline tối thiểu:

    Push / Pull Request
            ↓
    Install dependencies
            ↓
    Type Check
            ↓
    Lint
            ↓
    Unit Test
            ↓
    Build Frontend
            ↓
    Build Backend
            ↓
    Docker Build (nếu cần)
            ↓
    Pass

Branch strategy:
    main        → Production
    develop     → Integration
    feature/*   → Development
    release/*   → Release preparation
    hotfix/*    → Production fix

Comment convention:
    feat: add auth module
    fix: handle refresh token failure
    refactor: separate market provider adapter
    docs: update deployment guide
    test: add login integration tests
    chore: update dependencies